85
00:04:53.660 --> 00:04:58.119
So the highest category is high, then medium, and then the last one is low.

86
00:04:58.119 --> 00:05:01.720
So my friends, as you can see, with the help of the case, when we have created the new

87
00:05:01.720 --> 00:05:07.079
